<view class="page"><view class="business-tabs sticky-tabs"><view class="tab-indicator tab-{{activeSection}}"></view><view class="business-tab {{activeSection === 0 ? 'active' : ''}}" data-index="0" bindtap="jumpSection">校园套餐</view><view class="business-tab {{activeSection === 1 ? 'active' : ''}}" data-index="1" bindtap="jumpSection">话费权益</view><view class="business-tab {{activeSection === 2 ? 'active' : ''}}" data-index="2" bindtap="jumpSection">宽带资格</view></view><view class="official card"><view class="official-label">校园通信服务</view><view class="official-title">校园电话卡，线上咨询办理</view><view class="official-copy">套餐、话费权益、宽带资格分开办理，客服将在24小时内联系。</view></view><view id="plansSection" class="section-title business-section">1 · 选择校园套餐</view><view class="plans"><view wx:for="{{plans}}" wx:key="id" class="plan card {{selectedPlan === index ? 'selected' : ''}}" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="choosePlan"><view class="plan-top"><view><view class="plan-name">{{item.name}}</view><view class="plan-badge">{{item.badge}}</view></view><view><text class="plan-price">¥{{item.monthlyFee}}</text><text class="muted">/月</text></view></view><view class="plan-benefits"><text>{{item.data}}</text><text>{{item.voice}}</text></view></view></view><view class="form card"><view class="form-tip">当前选中：{{plans[selectedPlan].name}}</view><button class="primary-button" bindtap="submit">咨询套餐 / 预约办理</button></view><view id="rechargeSection" class="section-title promo-heading business-section"><text>2 · 限时话费权益</text><text class="limited">单独咨询</text></view><view class="recharge-grid"><view wx:for="{{rechargePromos}}" wx:key="id" class="recharge-card card"><view class="recharge-badge">{{item.badge}}</view><view class="recharge-title">充{{item.pay}}元</view><view class="recharge-value">到账 <text>¥{{item.receive}}</text></view><button size="mini" class="recharge-button" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="buyRecharge">咨询活动</button></view></view><view id="broadbandSection" class="section-title business-section">3 · 双人购卡宽带资格</view><view class="broadband card"><view class="broadband-title">两位同学购卡，可咨询宽带权益</view><view class="muted broadband-copy">客服核验双方号码和活动资格后，再确认办理方式。</view><button class="ghost-button" bindtap="applyBroadband">咨询宽带资格</button></view><view class="tips"><view class="tips-title">办理说明</view><view>· 套餐与活动以运营商最终确认结果为准</view><view>· 正式激活需本人完成实名核验</view></view></view>
